n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-questing\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Questing (by Funwayguy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-questing-standard-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Questing - 標準擴展 (by Funwayguy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coroutil\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoroUtil (by Corosus)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-awareness\" rel=\"nofollow\">殭屍感知 (by Corosus)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-18\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tissou的殭屍包 (by Tissou)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mowzies-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mowzie的生物 (by bobmowzie)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/llibrary\" rel=\"nofollow\">LLibrary (by mmdlexiconn)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-invisibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的隱形 (by Purplicious_Cow_)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftpresence\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftPresence (by CDAGaming_)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib (by ThanosGecko)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/future-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">未來 MC (by thedarkcolour)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fishs-undead-rising\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fish的不死崛起 (by fish0016054)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘋果核心 (by squeek502)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/defiled-lands\" rel=\"nofollow\">褻瀆之地 (by Lykrast)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-complement\" rel=\"nofollow\">匠魂補充 (by KnightMiner)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com