se)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bewitchment-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">巫術 (舊版) (by sunconure11)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trevor-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trevor的生物 (by matesu11)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiffitlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">TiffitLib (by tiffit_)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/camouflaged-creepers\" rel=\"nofollow\">偽裝苦力怕 (by georgetsak)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mantle\" rel=\"nofollow\">地幔 (by mDiyo)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horror-elements-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">恐怖元素模組 (by predator97427fr)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morpheus\" rel=\"nofollow\">夢神 (by Quetzi)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker (by Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG的更好洞穴 (Forge) (by YUNGNICKYOUNG)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-world-generator-port\" rel=\"nofollow\">默認世界生成器 (移植版) (by ezterry)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lumen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lumen 遺產 🔥 (by doctor4t)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darknesslib\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑暗庫 (by Shinoow)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/angry-pixel-the-betweenlands-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">[憤怒像素] 中間地帶 (by MrCompost)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ivtoolkit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iv工具包 (by Ivorforce)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recurrent-complex\" rel=\"nofollow\">循環複合體 (by Ivorforce)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creepypastacraft-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreepyPastaCraft 重生 (by Baushh_)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/codechicken-lib-1-8\" rel=\"nofollow\">CodeChicken Lib 1.8.+ (by covers1624)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dead-mans-abyss\" rel=\"nofollow\">死者深淵 (by PyrofabTheModsmith)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-shields\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達盾牌 (by ObliviousSpartan)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-midnight\" rel=\"nofollow\">午夜 (by cipher_zero_x)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">額外結構 (by XxRexRaptorxX)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵質背包 (by gr8pefish)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-trees-defiled-lands\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木 - 褻瀆之地 (by supermassimo0310)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalker-creepers\" rel=\"nofollow\">潛行苦力怕 (by atomicstrykergrumpy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">夸克 (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" rel=\"nofollow\">寧靜季節 (by TheAdubbz)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木 (by ferreusveritas)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookworm\" rel=\"nofollow\">書蟲 (by SoggyStache)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-tome\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗書 (by bl4ckscor3)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/macaws-fences-and-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw的柵欄與牆壁 (by sketch_macaw)</a>